# Owner-only paths

Never edit `spec/` or `data/gold/`. Never set `OWNER_SPEC_EDIT`. Never commit
with `--no-verify`.

Reads of `spec/` are required so an issue can quote the exact line.

A missing or ambiguous spec point stops the work that depends on it. Open an
issue labelled `needs-science-decision` with the quoted line and the concrete
options. Do not guess.

The M0 skeleton (headings and `TODO(owner)` only) is the baseline. It is not
permission to fill in science.
